  "$comment": "Harvested from af_core components/documents/wizard/utils/__tests__/matchScoring.test.ts (commit a2fe220). This is the CLIENT-SIDE scorer the document wizard used to rank bank transactions against a document (document → transactions direction). Max score 140 = amount 100 + date 30 + currency 10. 'Good match' = score ≥ 80. Amounts are plain numbers in v1 (display-side code).",
